      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Pennsylvania Railroad reached Caldwell in the 1870s, linking the village to eastern and northern markets along the Great Lakes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
