      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caldwell%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Caldwell serves as the county seat of Noble County, Ohio, anchoring the region’s administrative center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caldwell%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The village sits along the West Fork of Duck Creek, about 23 miles north of Marietta.",
